/**
 * PYTHON CONCURRENT.FUTURES COMPREHENSIVE ENGINE & BENCHMARK SUITE
 * 
 * Authored based on the architectural guide by Mauro Lomibao Dar III (2016-2026)
 * Demonstrates:
